╭─ Issue description ──────────────────────────╮
│ 1-element tuple rendered incorrectly         │
│ **Describe the bug**                         │
│ This is a followup to #7964 which has been   │
│ addressed in #8265.                          │
│                                              │
│ However the special case of a 1-element      │
│ tuple is still not handled correctly.        │
│                                              │
│ `(1,)` is rendered as `(1)`, but should keep │
│ the trailing comma.                          │
│                                              │
│ **To Reproduce**                             │
